&lt;p&gt;# Comments: 0&lt;/p&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50645782</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 18:39:02 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Show HN: I made a daily quiz game on AI bubble to unwind during stressful times</title><link>https://poptheaibubble.com</link><description>&lt;p&gt;Hello HN,&lt;p&gt;It's been a rough couple of days and weeks on the tech world + tech stock markets, so to unwind a little bit I created this fun game that presents 5 headlines every day and you need to pick your confidence on whether it's Real or it's a "Bubble".&lt;p&gt;Note that I don't want to make a judgment call on whether we are indeed in an AI bubble or not, and whether it's collapsing or not. The name and the game goes both ways and could support both cases imo. And the whole point of the game is exactly to try getting out of the whole speculation and have a little of fun.&lt;p&gt;There is no back-end, no auth, no account. It's just a JS bundle updated daily for the new questions to pop up. Your daily stats are stored in localStorage so if you want to keep your stats you need to use the same device evey day.&lt;p&gt;Cheers,
Guilherme Perotta&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
